id: pure-form-unpredictable
name: Unpredictable
order: 2
slot: trait
resource: channeledchaos
resourceLabel: Channeled Chaos
resourceMax: 99
description: >
  Your wild and unstable power is chaos incarnate, and even you don't know what will happen next!
text: >
  Unpredictable: Your wild and unstable power is chaos incarnate, and even you don't know what will happen next!
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you roll a 6 on your Chaos Die, enter the Superior State until the start of your next turn.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use a Healing Surge, roll your Chaos Die.
  (3)-[Triggered, Resource]: If you roll a 6 on your Chaos Die, gain a stack of Channeled Chaos.
  (4)-[Triggered]: After seeing the result of your Chaos Die, you may spend a stack of Channeled Chaos to increase or reduce the result by 1.
  (5)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Spend 2 stacks of Channeled Chaos. Until the end of this Combat Round, the Ki Point Cost of your Attacking Maneuvers is reduced to 0.
  (6)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Spend 3 stacks of Channeled Chaos. Until the end of this Combat Round, apply your Damage Attribute an additional time for all of your Attacking Maneuvers.
  (7)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: If you are in the Superior State, instead of gaining a Counter Action, you may gain an additional Action.

---

# (1)-(7) What the Chaos Die rolls: the table's.
